(CLAUSE 1: Para 4 \(Scope of Permissible Works\)) Tj T*
(Permissible works under Kudimaramath include desilting of supply channels,) Tj T*
(strengthening of tank bunds to standard TBL \(Tank Bund Level\), reconstruction of) Tj T*
(damaged masonry sluices and surplus weirs \(kalingals\), and clearing of Prosopis) Tj T*
(juliflora \(Seemai Karuvelam\) from the water spread area.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Para 6 \(Ayacutdar & WUA Participation\)) Tj T*
(Works up to Rs. 10 lakhs may be nominated directly to registered Water Users) Tj T*
(Associations \(WUAs\) / Ayacutdar Sangams with a mandatory 10% community) Tj T*
(contribution \(cash or labour\) and 90% State Government grant audited by the WRD) Tj T*
(Assistant Executive Engineer.) Tj T*
